1
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,670
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:12,210
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,380
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:18,970
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,950
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:26,370
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:28,330
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:29,860
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:31,350
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:33,210
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,200
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,810
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:38,260
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:42,460
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,460
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:44,760 --> 00:00:46,840
(Dashijie, Rongji)
(Presenting the Peerless Duo,)

17
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:49,680
(Admission by Ticket, Tickets on Sale)
(Lin Kefu, Su Yutang.)

18
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:50,840
(So beautiful!)

19
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:53,580
(Lin Kefu)

20
00:00:58,560 --> 00:01:01,040
(The Peerless Duo live up to their name)

21
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:04,440
(They're gorgeous!)

22
00:01:06,740 --> 00:01:08,680
(Su Yutang)

23
00:01:08,680 --> 00:01:09,880
(In this world,)

24
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:12,440
(no one is more in sync with me
than Kefu.)

25
00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:16,280
(Offstage, we're sworn sisters.)

26
00:01:16,640 --> 00:01:17,680
(Onstage,)

27
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:19,360
(we're the perfect magic partners.)

28
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:29,320
(What's the gun for?)

29
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:30,480
(Lu Shaoyun)

30
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:31,520
(Kefu and I)

31
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:33,640
(are always thinking of each other,)

32
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:35,160
(always care for each other,)

33
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:41,960
(and would never hurt each other.)

34
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:44,640
(Murder!)

35
00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:45,400
(She's bleeding!)

36
00:01:51,360 --> 00:01:52,400
(Su Yutang.)

37
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:53,640
(Tell us the truth.)

38
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:54,680
(Why did you kill her?)

39
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:57,240
You've got it wrong.

40
00:01:57,520 --> 00:01:58,560
I didn't kill her.

41
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,000
(Three Hours Earlier)
It was a magic trick.

42
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,040
A magic trick!

43
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:03,480
It's all an illusion.

44
00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:05,120
Lin Kefu isn't dead.

45
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:17,680
(But I never imagined)

46
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:20,640
(that her curtain call that night)

47
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:25,320
(would also be Kefu's final curtain.)

48
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:29,640
I'm heading out.

49
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:30,840
Where are you going?

50
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,200
I'll get something and be right back.

51
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:35,440
I got tickets to Magnolia,
your favorite.

52
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:36,200
Don't be late.

53
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:37,640
I know.

54
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:38,680
Go take off your makeup.

55
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:39,640
I'll be right back.

56
00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:41,000
Wait for me.

57
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:41,800
I will.

58
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:16,840
(If Kefu knew)

59
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:18,600
(I found her late mother's keepsake,)

60
00:03:18,920 --> 00:03:20,080
(she'd be so happy.)

61
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,040
Kefu!

62
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:36,560
Kefu!

63
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,000
Kefu!

64
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:41,720
Kefu!

65
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:44,080
Kefu!

66
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,160
What's wrong?

67
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:47,440
Who did this?

68
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,600
Somebody, come quick!

69
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:49,440
Help!

70
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:53,920
Inspector!

71
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:55,120
Please save my friend!

72
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,680
(Su Yutang commits arson and murder.)

73
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,040
(Take her away.)

74
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:03,440
Kefu!

75
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:04,520
Kefu!

76
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,040
Murder and arson.

77
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:07,240
Caught red-handed.

78
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:08,520
There's no denying it.

79
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:11,320
You've got the wrong person!

80
00:04:11,640 --> 00:04:12,840
I'm a witness.

81
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:14,800
A witness?

82
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:03,400
You're just in time.

83
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:06,280
Whoever has these two items

84
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:09,040
is Iron Leopard's biological daughter.

85
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:09,680
(He Jingchen)

86
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:10,920
She won't do.

87
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:11,600
Find another.

88
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,280
Why not her?

89
00:05:13,280 --> 00:05:15,400
Her height, age, and looks

90
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:17,080
all match.

91
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:24,360
Look at her.

92
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,280
Too timid.

93
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:27,960
Not quick enough.

94
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,440
With Iron Leopard,

95
00:05:29,440 --> 00:05:30,720
she wouldn't last three days.

96
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:34,120
I'll find someone more suitable.

97
00:05:34,520 --> 00:05:35,320
Get out.

98
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:46,120
How many times have I told you?

99
00:05:48,200 --> 00:05:49,880
When you find Iron Leopard's
biological daughter,

100
00:05:49,880 --> 00:05:51,200
tell me at once,

101
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:53,400
instead of killing her on your own.

102
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:56,560
But you also said

103
00:05:57,520 --> 00:05:58,600
we couldn't let his real daughter

104
00:05:58,600 --> 00:06:00,320
get a chance to meet him.

105
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:01,760
I figured

106
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:04,920
the dead can't cause trouble.

107
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:07,560
Don't worry.

108
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:08,840
I left no trace.

109
00:06:09,400 --> 00:06:10,200
No trace?

110
00:06:12,760 --> 00:06:13,960
Someone saw you.

111
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:15,480
Who?

112
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:32,640
Who are you?

113
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:38,040
You said you're a witness.

114
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:39,920
(He's in military uniform.)

115
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:42,160
(Is he from the Governor's Residence?)

116
00:06:43,520 --> 00:06:44,880
You saw the killer?

117
00:06:46,280 --> 00:06:46,880
Kefu!

118
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:47,720
Hang in there.

119
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,200
I'll take you to the hospital.

120
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:50,440
Yutang.

121
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:51,680
Listen to me first.

122
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:54,600
Lu Shaoyun is the killer.

123
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:56,440
(But Lu Shaoyun)

124
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:58,200
(is the young master of
the Governor's Residence.)

125
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:00,360
Tell me the truth.

126
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:04,920
Who is the killer?

127
00:07:07,960 --> 00:07:09,200
You're from the Governor's Residence.

128
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:12,640
This doesn't matter.

129
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:16,800
Let me go!

130
00:07:24,880 --> 00:07:26,240
You're quick.

131
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:28,880
Not as quick as you.

132
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:34,720
(I didn't expect a better candidate
to show up so soon.)

133
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:47,280
Awake?

134
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:48,880
You're lucky.

135
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:51,120
Before I came to see you,

136
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:54,080
I executed a few prisoners at camp.

137
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,600
I ran out of bullets.

138
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,840
(If he wanted to kill me to silence me,)

139
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:02,320
(he wouldn't go to all this trouble.)

140
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:04,400
(Since he brought me here,)

141
00:08:04,400 --> 00:08:06,440
(I still have a chance.)

142
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:09,960
So, are you going to shoot me again?

143
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:12,800
You still haven't named the killer.

144
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:14,480
(I can't tell him.)

145
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:15,800
(With people from the
Governor's Residence here,)

146
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:17,040
(I can't accuse one of their own)

147
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:18,720
(and expect to live.)

148
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,480
I didn't get a good look.

149
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:22,360
I only saw the killer from behind.

150
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:27,040
You didn't get a good look?

151
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:29,000
That puts the police in a bind.

152
00:08:37,640 --> 00:08:39,920
But Lin Kefu was murdered.

153
00:08:39,920 --> 00:08:41,440
And I didn't do it.

154
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:44,280
The police can't accuse a good person.

155
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,200
Is that so?

156
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:48,080
The police need to close the case.

157
00:08:48,280 --> 00:08:51,160
If she was murdered,
someone has to be the killer.

158
00:08:53,040 --> 00:08:54,360
I can give you a chance.

159
00:08:54,880 --> 00:08:56,000
What chance?

160
00:08:56,680 --> 00:08:58,160
A chance to be a good person.

161
00:08:58,640 --> 00:09:00,680
I ask. You answer.

162
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,080
Answer well,

163
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:04,200
and you might live to be one.

164
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:07,320
How did Lin Kefu die?

165
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:08,360
(He's right.)

166
00:09:09,680 --> 00:09:10,920
(If I insist she was murdered,)

167
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:12,280
(there has to be a killer.)

168
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,960
(If they protect the real killer,)

169
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:15,800
(they'll pin it on me.)

170
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:17,840
Was she murdered?

171
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:26,840
No one killed Lin Kefu.

172
00:09:27,760 --> 00:09:28,680
She died in the fire.

173
00:09:31,040 --> 00:09:32,680
Quick thinking.

174
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:36,120
But won't that weigh on your conscience?

175
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:40,480
But the theater can only have one
head magician.

176
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:42,000
You want to be head magician?

177
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:42,960
Of course.

178
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:44,840
I'm better at magic than she was.

179
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:46,320
Now that she's dead,

180
00:09:46,520 --> 00:09:47,560
this is my chance.

181
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:49,080
Why do you want to be head magician?

182
00:09:49,400 --> 00:09:50,280
For the money.

183
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,520
Good. Money makes things easy.

184
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,760
Now you have two choices.

185
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:58,800
One.

186
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,840
The police perform an autopsy.

187
00:10:01,680 --> 00:10:03,040
Cause of death: homicide.

188
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,960
You envied Lin Kefu's position
as head magician.

189
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:07,120
You're the prime suspect.

190
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:08,720
And you were caught red-handed.

191
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:09,720
Two.

192
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:11,160
She died in the fire.

193
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:13,200
From then on,

194
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:15,560
you'll have more money
than you can spend.

195
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,680
So...

196
00:10:18,760 --> 00:10:21,640
you decide what goes
in the autopsy report.

197
00:10:22,880 --> 00:10:24,960
Looks like I only have one choice.

198
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:28,840
I'll take that as your answer.

199
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:30,560
But before that,

200
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:33,160
I need you to help me
pull off a magic trick.

201
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:35,120
And we'll need a different stage.

202
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:36,520
Where's the new stage?

203
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:38,000
The Governor's Residence.

204
00:10:42,640 --> 00:10:43,640
The Governor's Residence?

205
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:46,680
You want me to perform magic there?

206
00:10:47,880 --> 00:10:51,160
I want you to become the young lady
of the Governor's Residence.

207
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:01,600
I see.

208
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:03,360
It's Kefu.

209
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:05,400
She's the governor's real daughter.

210
00:11:08,880 --> 00:11:10,160
After tonight,

211
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:13,760
you'll be the real young lady of
the Governor's Residence.

212
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:21,280
(Why dispose of his real daughter's body
and erase all traces?)

213
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:22,960
(Then find someone to replace her?)

214
00:11:25,920 --> 00:11:28,160
But no magic trick is ever done alone.

215
00:11:28,560 --> 00:11:29,880
I can be your assistant.

216
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:33,480
But before that,

217
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:36,800
I need to take something from you.

218
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:37,920
What?

219
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:42,040
Your weakness.

220
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:44,400
I have nothing.

221
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:46,000
What weakness could I have?

222
00:11:46,800 --> 00:11:47,720
The Governor's biological daughter

223
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:50,280
was born with a butterfly birthmark
on her left shoulder.

224
00:11:51,920 --> 00:11:53,840
Now you know your weakness.

225
00:12:02,660 --> 00:12:03,320
Turn around.

226
00:13:08,340 --> 00:13:12,250
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

227
00:13:14,300 --> 00:13:17,660
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

228
00:13:17,660 --> 00:13:20,310
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

229
00:13:21,810 --> 00:13:23,390
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

230
00:13:23,390 --> 00:13:27,510
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

231
00:13:28,050 --> 00:13:33,460
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

232
00:13:35,050 --> 00:13:38,390
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

233
00:13:38,390 --> 00:13:41,740
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

234
00:13:41,740 --> 00:13:44,300
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

235
00:13:44,300 --> 00:13:47,300
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

236
00:13:47,570 --> 00:13:53,820
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

237
00:13:54,310 --> 00:13:57,640
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

238
00:13:57,640 --> 00:14:00,870
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

239
00:14:00,870 --> 00:14:07,640
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

240
00:14:07,640 --> 00:14:10,890
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

241
00:14:10,890 --> 00:14:14,330
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

242
00:14:14,330 --> 00:14:16,470
♪Boundless♪
